  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Media Strengthening (MSP) Community Radios Project - 3 (CRP3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiatives views to support community radios in selected provinces of Mozambique. Community radios are the main sources of information for the majority of the population in the country. The aim is; citizens of Mozambians better informed and motivated to improve their lives and participate in governance process. The objectives are as follows, (i) journalists&#xB4; skills and ethics improved, (ii) financial sustainability of community radios increased, (iii) community engagement of the community radios enhanced, and (iv) increased access to information for People With Disability (PWD). The initiative will be implemenrted in four provinces of Maputo, Gaza, Sofala and Cabo Delgado, and benefit directly 26 community radios, including administrative staff, journalists, managers, radio listeners and the communities at large.</narrative>
  </description>
